<section class="panel-white">
  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-al-navy">Our Story</h2>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] lg:items-start">
      <figure>
        <img src="/images/about/ross-jocelyn.jpg" alt="Ross and Jocelyn Riley" class="w-full rounded-xl object-cover" />
        <figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-navy">Ross and Jocelyn Riley</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">In 2005, a young equestrian named Ross Riley recognized something missing from the horse supplement industry.</p>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">Despite countless products promising better performance and faster recovery, very few were designed to address the root cause of the problem using high-quality, naturally derived ingredients. Most focused on managing symptoms rather than supporting the body's own ability to heal.</p>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">Determined to find a better way, Ross began researching the science behind equine nutrition while working alongside his mother at her eventing stable. Horses had always been part of his life. His mother, Jocelyn Riley, is one of the oldest riders to compete at the Badminton Grassroots Championships, and his grandfather was a respected Thoroughbred trainer and breeder.</p>
        <blockquote class="my-8 border-l-2 border-al-orange pl-6 font-display text-xl font-medium leading-snug text-al-navy">"One of our top horses was struggling with persistent joint issues," Ross recalls. "I searched for a natural solution that could support recovery while improving long-term joint health, but I couldn't find a product I truly believed in."</blockquote>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">So he set out to create one. After years of research and product development, Ross launched Animalife's first innovation, Oxyshot®—the industry's first instant calmer. Its immediate success confirmed there was a growing demand for scientifically developed, naturally formulated alternatives.</p>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">That same philosophy continues to guide Animalife today. Every product is developed with one objective: to work in harmony with the body's natural biological systems, supporting long-term health, recovery, performance, and overall wellness rather than simply masking symptoms.</p>
        <p class="font-display mt-10 text-2xl font-medium text-al-navy">"Rooted in Nature. Proven by Science."</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

